      <div class="sb-card-desc">Download mods, resource packs, shaders, and the install guide for SpoonerCraft players.</div>
      <div style="margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Get mods →</div>
    </a>
  </div>
  <div class="sb-btn-row sb-reveal sb-reveal-d4" style="justify-content:flex-start;margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:0">
    <a class="sb-btn sb-btn-ghost" href="{{@site.url}}/guides/">All server guides &rarr;</a>
  </div>
</div>

<hr class="sb-divider">

